@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
skinparam BorderColor #4A5568
skinparam BackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #A67C00
title Shared staged ingestion pipeline
participant Plugin
participant Discovery
participant Downloader
participant Parser
participant Validator
participant Repository
Plugin -> Discovery : locate source when required
Discovery --> Plugin : source URI
Plugin -> Downloader : download source
Downloader --> Plugin : DownloadResult
Plugin -> Parser : parse bytes/file
Parser --> Plugin : typed or tabular data
Plugin -> Validator : validate
Validator --> Plugin : validation result
alt dry run
  Plugin --> Plugin : report metrics only
else database run
  Plugin -> Repository : persist in transaction
  Repository --> Plugin : insert/update/skip counts
end
@enduml
